ave a child, and then that child is also Milku alYameen, because you are Milku alYameen. That's not the case It's not the case in Islam, because it's not inherited So, whatever that is, whatever this understanding that I just gave you, what Milku alYameen is, it has nothing to do with the definition or understanding that people have about slavery So, that slavery does not exist in Islam",))
