on't need to fight. But Muslims are going to pay 2.5% of their wealth. Not only that, they're also going to fight. So it's not only that they pay 2.5% of Zakah Which is going to the \"Bait-ul-Mal\"; which is the \"House of Money\" The house of the state affairs to improve the state which the non-Muslim who's living there is also benefiting from.", "The Muslims are not only paying that money, they're also fighting when war happens. There is nothing more beautiful, I would say, than Jizya. That's why the Jewish people, for example, who were running away from Christians -like yourself- from the Crusades, and they went to Morocco and they begged: \"Please, let us pay the Jizya..\" -because they know the Jizya is a very small amount of money that only military-aged combatants will pay- \"and take us in and protect us from those Crusaders who want to chop our heads off!\" with words of \"oh, we love everyone, and peace, and love, and whatever.\"", "So this Jizya that you keep talking about.. \"Jizya, Jizya, Jizya..\" is the most merciful command that you can find in an Islamic state On the other hand, when Christians went into a land what they did is they plundered the land, took everything in the land, As is mentioned in Deuteronomy20:10 Look, I give you references. Unlike you, I'm not going to say, \"it's written in books\" \"in Encyclopaedia Britannica\" In some random source that doesn't exist.. No! the Bible explicitly mentions and teaches if you go and you conquer a city or take over a city or siege a city and take it, you take all of the goods in it for yourself.", "Now, if you want to talk about that and what happens in war I think you should start with your book and what your book teaches that you need to do to people before we talk about the Jizya. So that's what the Jizya is, my friend.",))
