 have been given the Scripture, it becomes permissible for you,) So, if it's a slaughtered meat by a Jew or a Christian, it’s permissible for a Muslim to eat So if you go today to Kosher restaurant as a Muslim- because they do slaughter their meat, they don't electrocute it, if you go to a kosher restaurant and they slaughter the meat, it’s permissible for you to eat that meat, but if the meat is electrocuted it's not permissible for you to eat.", "So they base that on this Fatwa or this issuing or this ruling that was given by these scholars years and years before Today the situation is completely different, today they do not slaughter the meat they electrocute the meat. That's number one. Number two, the people who are doing this are not Christians anymore. This is no longer a Christian country or even a Christian majority. According to the last census, the Christians are less than 50% in England and Wales. Christians have become less than 50% of the population, so no one can come and say that England is a Christian country or is a Christian-majority country, no longer this is the case and you'll see the people growing are the Muslims and Agnostics and Atheists These are people growing.", "Christians keep going down since 2010. The census said the same thing, They keep going down and the trajectory are Muslims are increasing and the Atheists and the Agnostic people are increasing So if it's an Atheist slaughtering, the meat is completely impermissible even if he slaughters it, not even just electrocuted If an Atheist does it, any type of meat he does we're not allowed to take from him if he kills that If it's a Christian or Jew, it has to be slaughtered and it has to be from a Christian or Jew Now the situation is they are Atheists so we cannot eat their meat and they electrocute the meat So for a fact, we cannot eat the meat that they're doing you know.", "Therefore we have to eat specifically from Halal-certified, even Halal-certified there is specific Halal-certified which can be trustworthy, for example in the UK like HMC because they do regular checks and they make sure that it's actually slaughtered and not electrocuted and things like that So this would be the answer to that question: you cannot go to McDonald's and say Bismillah and start eating, These people who are saying these things, they're completely saying incorrect things",))
