dn't necessarily need to mention it to you, and he narrated it from his teacher. There are certain Mua'llaaat that Bukhari mentioned بصيغة الجزم are authentic. But they don't know any of this, and they don't care to know, what they care to know is what? \"I don't care about Sahaba disagreeing, you know what, some Sahabi said this and some Sahabi said that..\" Even though no one disagreed about this issue. You're not going to find a single companion who disagreed with Abdullah Ibn Abbas and Ibn Massoud when they talked about the interpretation of the verses that I told you.", "Open the Tafassir you're not going to see them saying: \"No, this person is wrong, that's a different.. that's a wrong interpretation\" But they all become Scholars because of their desires. \"Music is OK brother, listen to music, don't be.. extremist, stop being extremist\" They listen to music These are the diseases we have in this Ummah.",))
