// T ML282 102,103,104,105,106,107,108,109,110,111 | The Muslim Lantern | dash: | cut:0
#host("The Muslim Lantern", ("Exactly! You know what, how can I not compromise? And we know Surat Alkafirun (109:1-6) The people came to the Prophetﷺ and they said you worship our God or Gods for a period of time, we worship your God for the same Same exact thing: compromise with us a little bit, you know give us our \"Merry Christmas\" a little bit and we give you the \"Eid Mubarak\" a little bit And then the Prophetﷺ completely rejected that, why? Because the minute you do that, you've entered into Disbelief. There's no options of compromising this and compromising that But those people, why do they do what you're saying?",))
