#other("Guest", ("That was about the compatibility of the West. So I think people they really find it difficult to have this separation because when you live in this Western culture where everything is liberalised and you have to.. take everything into account, so when the Christians are celebrating this, you have to congratulate them with their celebrations You have also the Easter bunny for example, I don't know where the bunny came from! Because they just tell us Eid Mubarak, so we have to do something as well like reciprocity right?",), cut: true)
// T ML282 222,223,224,225,226,227,228,229,230,231,232,233,234,235,236,237,238,239,240,241,242,243,244,245,246,247,248,249,250,251,252,253,254,255,256,257 | The Muslim Lantern | dash: | cut:0
#host("The Muslim Lantern", ("It's true that's a part of it that we mentioned which is the idea of compromise. But this is not the main issue The main issue is imitating the Kuffar, imitating the Disbelievers. This is the core thing. The Prophetﷺ he said: لَتَتَّبِعُنَّ سَنَنَ مَن قَبْلَكُمْ You will follow, you will tread the same steps that those who were before you tread even if they شبراً بشبر like step by step even if they enter into a hole when the animals dig the hole and stay inside you will go after them and then the people asked: Jews and Christians?", "The Prophet said who else! Who else? So the Prophetﷺ said that you will tread the same path, you will do the same thing that these people are doing, but then the Prophetﷺ.. how was his life? The Prophetﷺ if you read some of the books of Hadith which unfortunately people are not doing, but if you read the books of Hadith, you have chapters. These chapters are titled what? باب مخالفة اليهود والنصارى That's it! (The Chapter of Going Against the Jews and the Christians) And in the chapter; tens of Ahadith of the Prophetﷺ: Trim your moustache and grow your beard, go against the Jews and the Christians.", "Pray in your shoes because the Jews and Christians do not pray in their shoes These are all Ahadith I'm telling you know the Prophetﷺ what he was saying. Do not wear red clothes, just pure red.. because this is the habit of the Jews and the Christians. Certain hairstyles do not do this specific thing, because this is the habit of the Jews and the Christians. Even when the Verse was revealed -you see to which extent this was the case of the Prophetﷺ- is even when the verse was revealed (Albaqarah2:222) وَیَسۡـَٔلُونَكَ عَنِ ٱلۡمَحِیضِۖ (They ask you about menstruation) قُلۡ هُوَ أَذࣰى فَٱعۡتَزِلُوا۟ ٱلنِّسَاۤءَ فِی ٱلۡمَحِیضِ (say it is harmful so stay away from intercourse with women within the period of menstruation) Then they told the Prophetﷺ that the Jews at the time, they did not eat with their women, they did not touch their women, they stay away; different place from the women at the period of menstruation", "So the Prophetﷺ he said do everything except the intercourse. You can kiss your wife, you can hug your wife, you can eat with your wife, everything. Then when the Jews heard they said: this man! -or Prophet Muhammadﷺ- he doesn't leave anything except he goes against us in! To that extent, this was a known thing, it's for them this is not one instance in which the Prophet said this. They said he's not leaving anything except that he is going against us in",))
